# Build context for apps/server/Dockerfile (the repo root). Secrets and build output never go
# into an image; the mobile and web apps contribute only their manifests (the lockfile lists them).
.git
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/.expo
target
**/*.so
**/*.wasm
**/*.pdbk
apps/server/.data
apps/mobile/*
!apps/mobile/package.json
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
packages/crypto-native/android
deploy
docs
